              "text": "Marines that show exceptional close combat prowess are inducted into the Assault Squads. These squads excel at hit and run attacks, falling from the skies onto the enemies of Mankind. Armed with Bolt Pistols and Chainswords, and wearing holy Power Armour, these warriors strike terror into the hearts of their enemies. Jump Packs mean these squads can quickly jump into an area, cause considerable damage, and then jump out again.\n",
